# AI Knowledge Base Index

Use this map to pick the **right** source of truth. Prefer these over guessing from memory.

## Canonical sources (trust these)

| Document | Role |
|---|---|
| Root `CLAUDE.md` | Project-wide stack, invariants, test commands |
| `dashboard/DASHBOARD_KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md` | Dashboard flows, API contract, business rules, per-screen behavior |
| `core/CLAUDE.md` | Router map, auth tree, asyncpg patterns |
| `docs/adr/` | Architectural decisions and trade-offs |
| `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Focused agent guides per area (auto-loaded by glob) |
| `.cursor/skills/zizkadb-*/SKILL.md` | Setup, test, release workflows |

## OSS repo scope (important)

This open-source tree ships the **tenant dashboard**, API, SDKs, MCP, and marketing/community surfaces. It does **not** include the managed-cloud **operator admin console** (`/admin`, `/v1/admin/*`) — those sections in the KB are historical; do not implement admin routes here.

## Keep docs accurate

When your change affects behavior listed in a KB section, update that doc **in the same PR**. Stale docs mislead future AI sessions more than missing docs.

## Billing reality

No Stripe/checkout gate. Signup uses `selectBillingPlan` (POST `/v1/billing/select-plan`) after OTP. `billing_status_payload()` always returns `has_access: true`.
